只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Durable dependency-graph task factory for DeepSeek Harness: recurring Agent work, safe checkout lanes, first-class queues, Triage, and artifacts.","id":"gh:1344035098","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-factory","slug":"monotykamary/dsh-factory","topics":["ai-agents","cordis","deepseek-harness","dependency-graph","dsh-plugin","multi-agent-systems","sqlite","task-automation","typescript"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Durable dependency-graph task factory for DeepSeek Harness: recurring Agent work, safe checkout lane"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"s, first-class queues, Triage, and artifacts."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# 🏭 dsh-factory"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**Durable task graphs and recurring Agent work for DeepSeek Harness**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"_From one prompt to a dependency-aware production line — with isolated checkouts, live Sessions, and"},{"id":"p4s2","text":" reviewable results._"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"**dsh-factory** turns the ordinary DSH Session workflow into a durable local task factory. People ca"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"n capture work from New Session, models can build dependency graphs directly, and a lease-elected sc"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"heduler runs eligible nodes through native DSH Agents without introducing a second Agent loop, tool "},{"id":"p5s4","text":"registry, or conversation store."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Why Factory?"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"| | Capability | What it unlocks |\n| :-: | --- | --- |\n| 🕸️ | **Dependency graphs** | Parallel branc"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"hes, sequential chains, joins, and always-run finalizers in one named flow. |\n| 🏃 | **Native Agent r"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"uns** | Every assignment executes as an ordinary durable DSH Session with the selected model and pre"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"set. |\n| 🛤️ | **Safe checkout lanes** | Current, isolated, and predecessor-reuse lanes over managed "},{"id":"p7s5","text":"Git worktrees with dirty-work and live-Session protection. |\n| ⏰ | **One-shot + recurring schedules*"},{"id":"p7s6","text":"* | Delayed starts and Croner-backed recurrence with lease-safe activation and non-overlapping occur"},{"id":"p7s7","text":"rences. |\n| 🔁 | **Automatic failure retries** | Abruptly failed runs requeue with exponential backof"},{"id":"p7s8","text":"f — three retries starting at thirty seconds by default — with workspace and per-task opt-outs. |\n| "},{"id":"p7s9","text":"🏷️ | **Project-scoped identifiers** | Every workspace derives its own uppercase key with an independ"},{"id":"p7s10","text":"ent counter — DOCS-3 beside SR-2 — so cross-project dependencies stay mistake-proof while legacy FAC"},{"id":"p7s11","text":" numbers keep resolving. |\n| 💬 | **First-class discussion** | Posted prompts, steer messages, reorde"},{"id":"p7s12","text":"rable queued follow-ups, images, and Factory notes in one chronological feed. |\n| 🔎 | **Triage and a"},{"id":"p7s13","text":"rtifacts** | Unread and failed run results, mutation receipts, plus images and videos discovered und"},{"id":"p7s14","text":"er each run's `.artifacts/` directory. |\n| ✨ | **White-glove intake** | A compact Task/Flow selector"},{"id":"p7s15","text":" extends New Session instead of duplicating its Workspace, model, permission, attachment, and draft "},{"id":"p7s16","text":"w Session instead of duplicating its Workspace, model, permission, attachment, and draft controls. |"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## How it fits"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Factory is a control plane over DSH, not a replacement for it. Factory SQLite owns projects, tasks, "},{"id":"p10s2","text":"flows, schedules, runs, and review state. DSH remains authoritative for Agent execution, model-visib"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"le messages, pending prompt order, tools, attachments, Sessions, and worktree safety."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## The workflow"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"1. **Capture** — send normally to create a live Session, choose **Run later** for a draft task, or p"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"lace the prompt into a new or existing flow.\n2. **Compose** — add searchable dependencies, parallel "},{"id":"p12s3","text":"branches, joins, finalizers, labels, priorities, schedules, and model overrides.\n3. **Run** — the sc"},{"id":"p12s4","text":"heduler claims ready work, resolves a safe checkout lane, starts a DSH Agent, and logs the assignmen"},{"id":"p12s5","text":"t with dependency and mutation-ledger context.\n4. **Collaborate** — Queue and Steer post through the"},{"id":"p12s6","text":" Agent inbox; pending rows stay editable and reorderable until claimed.\n5. **Finish** — a missing re"},{"id":"p12s7","text":"port receives one logged next-step reminder; `factory_finish` is followed by one concise user-facing"},{"id":"p12s8","text":" result and settles only after the Session log is flushed.\n6. **Review** — Triage preserves each ter"},{"id":"p12s9","text":"minal occurrence, including recurring runs, receipts, summaries, failures, and `.artifacts/` media."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## Packages"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"| Package | Responsibility |"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"| `dsh-factory-protocol` | Host-independent task, flow, run, schedule, observation, and graph record"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"s. |\n| `dsh-factory-store` | Persistence Service Definition. |\n| `dsh-factory-store-sqlite` | Transa"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"ctional documents, presence, revisions, and scheduler leases. |\n| `dsh-factory-domain` | State trans"},{"id":"p15s4","text":"itions, metadata settlement, artifacts, and Typert Remote methods. |\n| `dsh-factory-tools` | Model g"},{"id":"p15s5","text":"raph tools, explicit completion, and the bundled Factory skill. |\n| `dsh-factory-scheduler` | Depend"},{"id":"p15s6","text":"ency, lane, cron, cleanup, and DSH Agent reconciliation. |\n| `dsh-factory-client-ui` | Work, task de"},{"id":"p15s7","text":"tail, Triage, New Session intake, and project settings. |\n| `dsh-factory` | Installable Cordis patch"},{"id":"p15s8","text":"w Session intake, and project settings. |\n| `dsh-factory` | Installable Cordis patch-layer bundle. |"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"### Monotykamary DSH flavor"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Factory ships in the custom Web profile beside Fabric and Fovea:"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"### Add to another compatible profile"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Restart the selected profile after installation. Factory appears as an additive Sidebar application "},{"id":"p22s2","text":"and stores its SQLite database under the DSH home."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"Install this checkout locally"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"The installer links all eight workspace packages, validates the composed Factory rows, and never sta"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"rts or restarts DSH."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## Safety model"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"A checkout is one serialized writer lane. Factory never force-removes a worktree, never deletes dirt"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"y work, and never releases a lane while shared presence reports a live Session. It refuses primary a"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"nd unmanaged checkout removal. Publishing remains an explicit task, and cleanup cannot rewrite a flo"},{"id":"p27s4","text":"ed checkout removal. Publishing remains an explicit task, and cleanup cannot rewrite a flow outcome."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"Recurring tasks return to **Scheduled** after every occurrence and retain each success or failure in"},{"id":"p28s2","text":" Triage. Scheduler takeover recovers only scheduler-owned dispatches, so observation of an external "},{"id":"p28s3","text":"Session cannot create a duplicate run."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## Browser experience"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"Work shows Emerging work first and then graph-ordered flows. Task detail combines properties, depend"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"encies, schedule, model selection, run output, discussion, mutation receipts, and review media. Link"},{"id":"p30s3","text":"ed Sessions can be settled or archived; cancelled tasks that never acquired a Session can be permane"},{"id":"p30s4","text":"ntly deleted after explicit acknowledgement. Relationship rails move from neutral pending nodes to a"},{"id":"p30s5","text":" blue running spinner, green completion check, or red abrupt-failure cross."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"Requirements: Node.js `^22.19.0 || >=24` and Bun 1.4+."},{"id":"p34s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
